<%= stylesheet_link_tag("home") %>

<div class="about-main">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-header">
      <h1>About Post</h1>
      <p class="about-tagline">Where voices connect and ideas flourish</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
      <div class="about-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
      </div>
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>
        Post was created with a simple belief: everyone has a story worth sharing.
        In a world where genuine connection matters more than ever, we built a platform
        that puts your voice first—no algorithms hiding your thoughts, no complicated
        features getting in the way. Just you, your ideas, and a community ready to listen.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
      <div class="about-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i>
      </div>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        We believe in the power of authentic expression. Our mission is to create a
        welcoming space where people can share their thoughts, spark meaningful conversations,
        and build genuine connections. Whether you're sharing a moment of inspiration,
        asking a question, or simply expressing yourself, Post is your canvas.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-features">
      <h2>Why Choose Post?</h2>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon-small">
            <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Simple & Fast</h3>
          <p>Share your thoughts instantly. No clutter, no distractions—just pure, seamless expression.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon-small">
            <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Real Community</h3>
          <p>Connect with people who value genuine interaction. Build relationships that matter.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon-small">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Your Privacy Matters</h3>
          <p>We respect your data and protect your privacy. Your posts, your control.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon-small">
            <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Support & Appreciation</h3>
          <p>Show love for posts that resonate with you. Every reaction builds connection.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon-small">
            <i class="fas fa-globe"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Global Reach</h3>
          <p>Your voice can reach people across the world. Share ideas without boundaries.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon-small">
            <i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Always Accessible</h3>
          <p>Access your community anywhere, anytime. Responsive design for all devices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
      <div class="about-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-compass"></i>
      </div>
      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <ul class="values-list">
        <li><strong>Authenticity:</strong> Be yourself. Real voices create real connections.</li>
        <li><strong>Respect:</strong> Every person deserves to be heard and treated with dignity.</li>
        <li><strong>Simplicity:</strong> Great experiences don't need complexity.</li>
        <li><strong>Community:</strong> Together, we're stronger. Every member matters.</li>
        <li><strong>Growth:</strong> Learn, evolve, and inspire each other daily.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="about-stats">
      <h2>Our Growing Community</h2>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
          <div class="stat-number"><%= User.count %></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Active Members</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <i class="fas fa-comments"></i>
          <div class="stat-number"><%= UserMessage.count %></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Posts Shared</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
          <div class="stat-number"><%= Like.count %></div>
          <div class="stat-label">Reactions Given</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-cta">
      <h2>Ready to Share Your Voice?</h2>
      <p>Join our community and start connecting with people who inspire you.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <% if logged_in? %>
          <%= link_to new_user_message_path, class: "btn btn-hero btn-primary" do %>
            <i class="fas fa-pencil-alt"></i> Create Your First Post
          <% end %>
        <% else %>
          <%= link_to new_user_path, class: "btn btn-hero btn-primary" do %>
            <i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Join Post Today
          <% end %>
          <%= link_to login_path, class: "btn btn-hero btn-secondary-hero" do %>
            <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt"></i> Sign In
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-footer">
      <div class="credits">
        <h3>Credits & Acknowledgments</h3>
        <p>
          <i class="fas fa-icons"></i>
          <a href="https://www.flaticon.com/free-icons/animals" title="animals icons" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Avatar icons created by Freepik - Flaticon
          </a>
        </p>
        <p>
          <i class="fas fa-palette"></i>
          Colors inspired by <a href="https://nipponcolors.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NIPPON COLORS</a> - Traditional Japanese color palette
        </p>
        <p>
          <i class="fas fa-images"></i>
          Background images from <a href="https://unsplash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unsplash</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-info">
        <p>Have questions or feedback? We'd love to hear from you.</p>
        <p class="made-with-love">
          <i class="fas fa-heart"></i> Built with care for meaningful connections
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>